        <mxCell id="pcNote" value="The 16 nt barcode is pre-synthesised and identifies the &lt;i&gt;bead&lt;/i&gt;; the 12 nt UMI is random on each oligo copy." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=right;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=8.5;fontColor=#666666;" vertex="1" parent="1">
